{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.pair_viscous_core_race","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.pair_viscous_core_race","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.viscous_race_won","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.viscous_race_won","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L103-L120","doc":"**The viscous race summary**: for every positive viscosity the\noverlap condition engages at a strictly positive time, strictly\nbefore the inviscid collision time, at strictly positive\nseparation — with *no* strain-driven core growth assumed.  The\ntwo-regime model's regularizing cutoff is therefore robust to\nremoving its least-PDE-grounded ingredient: the diffusive\n(Lamb–Oseen, exact-NS) channel alone forces engagement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.sep_pos_at_tOverlap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.sep_pos_at_tOverlap","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L91-L101","doc":"**Positive separation at overlap**: the cutoff engages while the\npair is still separated — `d²(t_ov) > 0`.  (Explicitly,\n`d²(t_ov) = (4ν·d₀² + r·a₀²)/(r + 4ν)`.) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.core_meets_sep_at_tOverlap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.core_meets_sep_at_tOverlap","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L81-L89","doc":"At the crossing time the core exactly meets the separation:\n`a²(t_ov) = d²(t_ov)` (the overlap condition engages). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap_lt_collision","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap_lt_collision","kind":"theorem","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L70-L79","doc":"**The race is won strictly before the inviscid collision time**\n`t* = d₀²/r`: viscosity's head start (`a₀² ≥ 0`) and its own\ncontribution to the closing speed both shorten the crossing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap_pos","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L63-L68","doc":"The crossing time is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.tOverlap","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L55-L57","doc":"The crossing time of the linear race:\n`t_ov = (d₀² − a₀²)/(r + 4ν)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.sepSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.sepSq","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L51-L53","doc":"Phase-1 separation-squared (as in `pair_phase1_riccati`):\n`d²(t) = d₀² − r·t` with `r = Γ/π`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.coreSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.PairViscousRace.coreSq","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/pair_viscous_core_race.lean#L48-L49","doc":"Viscous (Lamb–Oseen) core variance: `a²(t) = a₀² + 4νt`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}